        {
          "text": "Nũndũ nĩnĩmwĩsĩ, nĩ kana eaĩae syana syake na andũ make ĩtina wake, makwate nzĩa ya Yeova, mekae ũlũngalu na ũsili wa katĩ; nĩ kana Yeova amũetee Avalaamu ũndũ ũla waneenie ũndũ wake. ",
